## How it was tested

- The `content:generic:generic-locs` integration suite passes with `spotlessCheck`, after `freshCache`.
- In game at 513144d3d, whose production code is identical to this head (only the test file was dropped since) (desktop RuneLite through RSProx on a branch server, the Sheep Shearer pen stile at 3197,3276), from 2 tiles south and 1 tile north in line, from beside the stile along the fence on both sides, from a diagonal tile on both sides, from 4-6 tiles south-west, from 3 tiles north-east, and standing on the in-line tile. In our own RSProx transcript of that session every crossing went: the in-line tile on the player's side, the next tick onto the near stile tile, the tick after that the climb (seq 839, exactmove 30/94), three ticks later onto the tile beyond the stile, the same ticks as the official recording below. No server errors.

